=== the device: two boots, a key made once and a record it can publish ===
device: enrol fleet_temoin ed25519 KEY1 -- KEY for this machine's MEMBER in a fleet
device: enrol fleet_temoin ed25519 KEY1 -- KEY for this machine's MEMBER in a fleet
device: record seq=1 prev=- machine=fleet_temoin declaration=3766180a75088e11 verdict=matched hash=H sig=S
carried: 1 entry off the machine, as the exact bytes that were signed
=== the roll before enrolment ===
roll: fleet atelier -- 1 member, no shared link declared -- judged, no refusal
roll:   temoin -- fleet_temoin (fleet_temoin.machine) -- KEEPS A RECORD AND IS NOT ENROLLED: nobody can verify what it signs
roll: fleet atelier -- 1 member keeps a signed record that no holder of this file can check; enrol from the line the device prints on its own console
=== the roll after enrolment ===
roll: fleet atelier -- 1 member, no shared link declared -- judged, no refusal
roll:   temoin -- fleet_temoin (fleet_temoin.machine) -- enrolled, fingerprint FP1
=== the act: a record verified by somebody who does not hold the secret ===
verify: fleet atelier -- temoin: 1 entry verified against the enrolled key (fingerprint FP1), and no secret took part
=== negative 1: one word changed, and it is the verdict ===
tampered: fleet atelier -- temoin: entry 1 is not this device's: the entry's own bytes do not hash to the hash it carries: it was altered after it was written
tampered: fleet atelier -- 0 entries verified before it
=== negative 2: the same record offered as another device's ===
foreign: fleet atelier -- temoin: entry 1 is not this device's: this device's key did not sign this entry
foreign: fleet atelier -- 0 entries verified before it
=== negative 3: a member nobody has enrolled ===
unenrolled: fleet atelier -- temoin has no KEY in this fleet: nobody can speak for its records until its own fingerprint is enrolled
=== the estate's own fleet, judged ===
salle: fleet salle_makeen -- 2 members on salle, served by boitier -- judged, no refusal
salle:   boitier -- makeen_names (makeen_names.machine, 192.168.10.1/24, serves makeen) -- not enrolled
salle:   caisse -- caisse_makeen (caisse_makeen.machine, asks) -- not enrolled
